Package: libwyoming0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libs
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Wyoming voice protocol library
 libwyoming is a C library implementing the Wyoming voice protocol
 used by Home Assistant for TTS, ASR, and other voice services.
 Provides client and server APIs over TCP with JSON-line framing
 and binary audio payloads.

Package: libwyoming-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libdevel
Depends: libwyoming0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Wyoming voice protocol library (development files)
 libwyoming is a C library implementing the Wyoming voice protocol
 used by Home Assistant for TTS, ASR, and other voice services.
 .
 This package contains the header files and pkg-config file needed
 to build programs that use libwyoming.
